(text "OPERATOR INPUTS (RC-filtered ADC)" (at 20.32 139.7 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid a3782911-ef7f-4037-810b-ef071a4e60cd))
(text "NOTES. A concept drawn by Claude at Bob Drzyzgula's direction, October 2026: not built, not tested, values not checked." (at 20.32 257.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 3e43bf96-67c5-4c8f-987c-96888731bf10))
(text "1. After Freescale AN1662: zero-cross interrupt sets a timer alarm (or a PIO program); at the firing delay a ~100 us gate pulse fires the" (at 20.32 260.2 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid b3ee5fde-09b0-4635-b838-e4714cecc7b8))
(text "   triac; hand-wheel period from edge timestamps; speed loop every half-cycle (120 Hz); stall watchdog. Added: isolation, relay, inputs." (at 20.32 263.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid cbbcbb2f-13f8-4188-a6dc-167a1ba55828))
(text "2. Pins (RP2350B): FIRE GP4; RELAY GP5; ZC GP6; HALL GP7; STITCH GP10; NEEDLE GP12; knee, pedal, FSR, limit on ADC0-3 (GP40-43)," (at 20.32 266.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 4290902a-522e-42b0-8c88-d0d87c3e6736))
(text "   ADC4-7 spare; GP0/GP1 UART0 for a debug line (or USB serial). Any GPIO will do for the digital signals; wire by GPIO number." (at 20.32 269.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid cf0d8213-f32b-46b7-a712-f2ab464b4b6e))
(text "3. PS1 feeds VSYS through D2, so USB may stay plugged in (the control side is SELV). Flash by UF2 (BOOTSEL) or SWD. Drive GP4 at 8-12 mA." (at 20.32 273.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 614703d7-216a-4f12-9050-2477b802d706))
(text "4. Fire only after a zero-cross has been seen and the command is zero; close K1 last and open it first. Never scope the line side." (at 20.32 276.2 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 88ae2dd7-7e82-465d-a221-540046dd198a))
(text "5. R7/R8: ~3.9 mA peak in the H11AA1; R11: ~8 mA into U3 from 3.3 V; R6/C2 fitted only if a snubberless triac false-fires." (at 20.32 279.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid ea50dd6e-9f69-4bf9-ae56-914e7e283469))
